WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:40.870 --> 01:42.210
What did you smell?

01:42.480 --> 01:44.690
I smell Changgeng the Great is here.

01:44.710 --> 01:45.820
I must have him as my Mentor.

02:03.430 --> 02:04.770
Found it.

02:05.040 --> 02:07.540
I still don't know Changgeng's

02:07.560 --> 02:09.010
true appearance,

02:09.080 --> 02:11.060
but as long as he is here,

02:12.800 --> 02:13.980
the Pregenesis Sword

02:14.470 --> 02:16.100
must be here too.

02:19.750 --> 02:21.010
Elder Kuai Si,

02:21.470 --> 02:23.060
it's time to act.

02:58.150 --> 02:59.010
Mentor, what are you doing?

02:59.030 --> 03:00.170
Always so jumpy.

03:00.190 --> 03:00.780
What's wrong?

03:02.800 --> 03:04.220
Is that how you talk to your Mentor?

03:04.280 --> 03:05.260
Show some respect.

03:05.430 --> 03:07.060
Mind your tone with your disciple.

03:07.470 --> 03:08.220
Next time you speak to your Mentor,

03:08.240 --> 03:09.290
watch it a little.

03:19.560 --> 03:20.780
Stop fidgeting.

03:20.800 --> 03:21.820
What's wrong?

03:22.000 --> 03:23.010
There's a mosquito.

03:38.280 --> 03:40.010
It wasn't this dark earlier.

03:40.840 --> 03:41.610
You kidding me?

04:13.960 --> 04:14.730
So dark in here.

04:55.830 --> 04:56.380
Hi.

04:58.140 --> 05:01.100
[Episode 19]

05:01.100 --> 05:01.780
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

05:26.830 --> 05:28.020
What are you screaming for?

05:32.630 --> 05:33.460
What's going on?

05:44.870 --> 05:45.660
Possession?

05:50.040 --> 05:51.020
Help! Run!

05:51.040 --> 05:51.700
Hanzhi, go.

05:51.720 --> 05:52.100
Mentor.

05:52.430 --> 05:53.810
Pearl Elites, form up.

06:02.870 --> 06:03.610
Run.

06:03.630 --> 06:04.250
Run.

06:07.480 --> 06:08.220
Xiong Da.

06:08.480 --> 06:09.460
She's up there.

06:09.480 --> 06:10.850
Lingli, run.

06:13.240 --> 06:15.340
It hurts so much.

06:30.240 --> 06:30.900
Stay back.

06:33.070 --> 06:34.700
No, don't bite me.

06:34.870 --> 06:35.370
No.

06:35.510 --> 06:36.020
Don't bite.

06:45.480 --> 06:47.660
Ascendance disciples, fall back.

06:57.240 --> 06:58.100
Can't bite through?

06:58.310 --> 06:59.100
Beat it.

07:00.870 --> 07:01.610
Why doesn't it hurt?

07:05.390 --> 07:06.540
You even bit my crotch.

07:06.600 --> 07:08.580
So shameless.

07:10.270 --> 07:12.100
Brothers, they eat people.

07:19.420 --> 07:23.940
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

07:34.000 --> 07:35.250
It's really solid.

07:35.430 --> 07:36.220
Impressive.

07:38.480 --> 07:39.250
Who?

07:41.000 --> 07:41.900
3,000 spirit stones.

07:48.040 --> 07:49.140
You Seizing Sect evildoer.

07:49.160 --> 07:51.250
Still trying to trick Ascendance Sect?

07:52.070 --> 07:52.850
Get out!

07:55.480 --> 07:56.170
Just you wait.

08:09.430 --> 08:10.170
What?

08:10.920 --> 08:12.050
What's happening out there?

08:30.190 --> 08:31.250
Xuanya, get inside.

08:36.840 --> 08:38.650
Brat, what's going on?

08:41.600 --> 08:42.490
It's nothing.

08:42.630 --> 08:43.850
I heard the sounds of fighting.

08:43.870 --> 08:44.820
Let me see.

08:44.960 --> 08:46.460
It's the Demon Clan. A sneak attack.

08:46.870 --> 08:47.650
A sneak attack?

08:48.390 --> 08:49.250
Don't worry, Yunxiao.

08:49.790 --> 08:51.370
Everything is going as planned.

08:51.480 --> 08:52.220
Just...

08:52.480 --> 08:54.100
It came sooner than I expected.

08:54.870 --> 08:56.770
What about my fellow cultivators?

08:56.790 --> 08:57.890
Go away.

08:58.200 --> 08:59.980
They are safe with Zhao Gongming.

09:01.080 --> 09:02.010
Rest assured, Yunxiao.

09:04.870 --> 09:06.250
Uncle, run.

09:32.600 --> 09:33.370
What are you doing?

09:33.670 --> 09:35.100
Senior is in there. I must save her.

09:35.200 --> 09:36.250
Calm down.

09:36.630 --> 09:38.370
You can't save her on your own.

09:39.270 --> 09:40.980
Remember what I told you about hearts?

09:41.150 --> 09:41.940
Hearts?

09:43.840 --> 09:45.980
Even the strongest man is futile alone.

09:46.080 --> 09:49.180
Only a leader can save everyone.

09:50.270 --> 09:51.180
What should I do?

09:52.840 --> 09:54.420
Don't catch me. Run.

09:55.030 --> 09:56.700
Brothers, run.

09:57.550 --> 09:58.220
Run.

09:58.510 --> 09:59.420
The timing is perfect.

09:59.790 --> 10:00.770
Second Prince,

10:01.320 --> 10:02.060
you have absorbed the Spiritual Power

10:02.080 --> 10:04.220
of half the Mini Realm Scroll.

10:04.600 --> 10:06.060
Ready to test your strength?

10:17.240 --> 10:19.730
Time to turn the tide and make a name.

10:19.750 --> 10:20.460
Your Highness,

10:20.480 --> 10:21.530
show your power.

10:21.550 --> 10:22.370
Bring them to heel.

10:22.390 --> 10:23.980
Make them your first followers.

10:27.960 --> 10:29.460
I am Ao Yi, destined to be a light

10:29.870 --> 10:31.460
that shines upon the entire East Sea.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.340
Senior.

10:36.270 --> 10:37.300
I will save you.

10:38.240 --> 10:39.650
Transform into a dragon.

10:44.790 --> 10:45.890
Run. Keep up.

10:46.670 --> 10:47.420
Run.

10:48.600 --> 10:49.340
What is that?

10:49.870 --> 10:51.700
A great Deity.

10:52.670 --> 10:54.220
A Deity.

10:56.720 --> 10:57.820
We are saved.

11:06.360 --> 11:08.820
No dragon. Just a worm.

11:09.840 --> 11:10.890
Run that way.

11:13.080 --> 11:13.980
Don't go.

11:14.000 --> 11:14.980
Give me a chance.

11:21.270 --> 11:22.300
Dragon's Prophecy...

11:23.840 --> 11:25.100
Still hasn't recovered.

11:25.390 --> 11:26.250
What do we do now?

11:27.360 --> 11:29.370
Seems we need the old way.

11:30.670 --> 11:31.650
The old way?

11:33.870 --> 11:34.580
Run.

11:34.750 --> 11:35.340
Keep up.

11:36.150 --> 11:37.530
Hurry. Run faster.

11:58.270 --> 11:59.700
So impressive.

12:01.630 --> 12:04.180
You absorbed half the scroll's power.

12:04.270 --> 12:06.700
Even without transforming,
you are still strong.

12:10.270 --> 12:11.010
My power

12:11.600 --> 12:12.850
is back.

12:13.480 --> 12:14.850
Isn't he...

12:15.080 --> 12:15.980
The worm from earlier?

12:16.630 --> 12:17.890
No wonder he looks familiar.

12:19.600 --> 12:20.580
Sea Deity Sect disciples.

12:21.270 --> 12:23.250
Forgot what Sea Deity taught you?

12:25.270 --> 12:25.980
Taught us what?

12:45.000 --> 12:46.010
On my command.

12:51.080 --> 12:51.730
Fire.

13:17.960 --> 13:18.980
Cultivators of Seizing Sect.

13:19.750 --> 13:21.250
Why commit such bloodshed?

13:22.270 --> 13:23.060
Detached Master,

13:24.080 --> 13:27.060
why do you think we came to your sect?

13:27.790 --> 13:29.060
With your current cultivation,

13:29.080 --> 13:31.460
you must foresee Ascendance Sect's

13:31.670 --> 13:33.060
tribulation in 500 years.

13:34.670 --> 13:37.610
How do you know that?

13:38.750 --> 13:40.490
But when that tribulation arrives,

13:40.550 --> 13:42.250
and we face life or death,

13:42.550 --> 13:45.220
I believe the Three Sects here

13:45.240 --> 13:46.980
can put aside the past

13:47.270 --> 13:48.460
and stand as one.

13:48.790 --> 13:51.820
I want to use that tribulation

13:52.360 --> 13:55.250
to begin Unity of the Three Sects.

13:56.030 --> 13:57.250
You were worried

13:57.870 --> 14:01.060
your sect couldn't survive alone,

14:01.360 --> 14:04.060
so you kept us as a backup plan.

14:04.080 --> 14:04.850
But you didn't know

14:04.870 --> 14:07.850
our Seizing Sect is your tribulation.

14:08.000 --> 14:09.250
We came here today

14:09.270 --> 14:12.010
to bury Ascendance Sect

14:12.480 --> 14:14.650
along with your dream of unity.

14:24.120 --> 14:24.890
Grandlord.

14:25.120 --> 14:26.010
Grandlord.

14:27.270 --> 14:29.580
Attack!

15:01.080 --> 15:03.370
Jiu Jiu is here. Meet your Death!

15:04.160 --> 15:06.420
♪Always a lamp to light the valley♪

15:06.420 --> 15:08.740
♪Or flying up to the heavens alone♪

15:09.280 --> 15:12.270
♪To demand justice for the world♪

15:12.270 --> 15:13.060
Backup?

15:14.080 --> 15:14.980
Little Uncle.

15:15.000 --> 15:16.010
Charge!

15:16.010 --> 15:19.950
♪Someone will answer for me♪

15:20.080 --> 15:20.850
Senior.

15:21.150 --> 15:21.890
Thank goodness you're okay.

15:21.910 --> 15:22.460
Where is Mentor?

15:22.630 --> 15:24.060
He got blown away.

15:24.200 --> 15:26.340
♪Taking our steps together♪

15:27.490 --> 15:33.550
♪Fearing no storm or karma♪

15:33.840 --> 15:34.580
Grandlord.

15:36.410 --> 15:37.960
♪Acting like fierce demons♪

15:37.960 --> 15:38.650
Grandlord.

15:39.080 --> 15:40.420
What's wrong, Grandlord?

15:43.970 --> 15:45.760
♪Who plots and schemes♪

15:46.570 --> 15:48.520
♪And set formations in the world♪

15:49.120 --> 15:52.600
♪I will go in and stir things up♪

15:52.600 --> 15:54.010
Why isn't Senior back yet?

15:54.120 --> 15:56.060
♪Amid the clamoring voices♪

15:57.030 --> 15:57.700
Senior.

15:58.150 --> 15:59.700
Senior. I'm so glad you're okay.

16:00.030 --> 16:01.250
Saw the fight outside and still ran out?

16:01.270 --> 16:02.650
Copy Scripture of Steadiness 500 times.

16:02.870 --> 16:03.650
I will.

16:03.670 --> 16:04.300
Jiu Jiu.

16:04.320 --> 16:04.850
Grandlord.

16:05.000 --> 16:05.820
Why are you here?

16:05.840 --> 16:06.610
Over a dozen miles away,

16:06.630 --> 16:08.980
a Demon Army is heading this way.

16:09.270 --> 16:11.250
Did Seizing Sect collude with them

16:11.270 --> 16:12.650
to conquer Ascendance Sect?

16:12.870 --> 16:14.060
Time to show them what we've got.

16:14.270 --> 16:15.610
Disciples, after them.

16:15.790 --> 16:17.060
Capture them all!

16:19.870 --> 16:20.650
Here.

16:21.440 --> 16:22.220
Where to?

16:23.550 --> 16:24.650
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

16:26.790 --> 16:27.890
Defending Formation.

16:28.510 --> 16:29.490
Open.

16:47.960 --> 16:51.300
Elders of all divisions, hold it firmly.

16:57.830 --> 16:58.880
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

16:58.960 --> 16:59.740
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

16:59.740 --> 17:00.370
Grandlord.

17:00.550 --> 17:01.270
- Grandlord.
- Grandlord.

17:01.270 --> 17:01.820
Grandlord.

17:02.150 --> 17:02.890
Grandlord.

17:12.200 --> 17:13.180
What a pity.

17:13.510 --> 17:15.050
We couldn't capture Zhao Gongming.

17:15.350 --> 17:18.090
If we could make him the leader,

17:18.400 --> 17:21.250
the story of Seizing Sect's attack

17:23.160 --> 17:24.700
would be much more interesting.

17:26.880 --> 17:28.860
Defending Formation?

17:29.160 --> 17:31.050
Smash it.

17:46.440 --> 17:47.250
Go. Go.

17:47.680 --> 17:49.290
Disciples below Verity Immortal,

17:49.440 --> 17:51.050
shelter in the Hall of Mortal Coils.

17:51.070 --> 17:52.180
Careful.

17:59.110 --> 17:59.900
Go, go, go.

18:00.030 --> 18:01.420
Senior, should we run?

18:02.070 --> 18:03.220
Have you reached Verity Immortal?

18:03.240 --> 18:03.860
Not yet.

18:03.880 --> 18:05.050
Then why are you just watching?

18:05.070 --> 18:05.660
Run.

18:05.680 --> 18:07.250
Keep up. Be careful.

18:23.680 --> 18:24.420
Now that

18:25.030 --> 18:26.460
the Grandlord is heavily injured,

18:27.480 --> 18:30.010
I am the only Aureate Immortal here.

18:30.550 --> 18:33.620
Naturally, I should give the orders.

18:36.000 --> 18:37.010
With the Grandlord absent,

18:37.310 --> 18:38.050
all orders

18:38.070 --> 18:40.050
must be decided by the elders.

18:40.480 --> 18:41.900
This is our sect's tradition.

18:42.160 --> 18:42.940
Kuai Si,

18:43.680 --> 18:45.250
do you want to break the rule?

18:45.270 --> 18:47.900
There's no time to debate in crisis.

18:48.070 --> 18:49.420
Do as I say.

18:49.680 --> 18:52.050
All elders, lead the disciples

18:52.070 --> 18:53.810
to retreat to Hall of Mortal Coils.

18:53.960 --> 18:55.660
The Grandlord ordered before passing out

18:55.830 --> 18:57.620
that we must
hold the Defending Formation.

18:57.640 --> 18:58.860
We should stay here

18:58.880 --> 19:00.620
and feed it Spiritual Power.

19:00.640 --> 19:03.330
Defend, and Spiritual Power runs dry.

19:03.350 --> 19:05.380
Once the formation falls,

19:05.400 --> 19:06.460
and we have no power left,

19:06.480 --> 19:07.810
wouldn't that be suicide?

19:07.830 --> 19:08.620
But the Grandlord said...

19:08.640 --> 19:09.810
The Grandlord?

19:10.270 --> 19:11.860
The Seizing Sect broke in

19:11.880 --> 19:13.620
because the Grandlord messed up.

19:13.640 --> 19:15.050
He let them into Ascendance Sect.

19:15.070 --> 19:15.460
You...

19:15.480 --> 19:16.250
That's true.

19:16.270 --> 19:18.660
Our sect has been in total chaos

19:19.270 --> 19:21.420
because the Grandlord allowed it.

19:22.070 --> 19:24.220
The Elucidating guests fled the crisis.

19:24.350 --> 19:26.420
And the Seizing disciples had schemes.

19:26.440 --> 19:27.860
There is absolutely no honor

19:28.160 --> 19:29.900
among these Three Sects.

19:29.920 --> 19:30.290
You all...

19:30.680 --> 19:31.250
He's right.

19:31.270 --> 19:34.050
Please, Elders,

19:34.960 --> 19:37.140
retreat to Hall of Mortal Coils now.

19:37.480 --> 19:38.250
Do not delay.

19:38.270 --> 19:38.730
Yes.

19:38.750 --> 19:39.460
Wait.

19:40.070 --> 19:42.460
If Seizing Sect and Demon Army attack,

19:42.790 --> 19:44.420
what about the other divisions?

19:48.200 --> 19:50.420
Then those divisions can only blame

19:52.270 --> 19:53.860
their ill fortune.

19:53.920 --> 19:54.620
Move aside.

19:55.400 --> 19:56.570
Make way. All of you.

19:57.030 --> 19:57.620
Move.

19:58.000 --> 19:58.460
Grandlord.

19:58.480 --> 19:59.140
Grandlord.

20:01.200 --> 20:01.860
Grandlord.

20:02.590 --> 20:03.140
Grandlord.

20:04.400 --> 20:05.010
This is bad.

20:06.200 --> 20:06.980
Where are you going?

20:07.240 --> 20:08.010
I'm looking for Mentor.

20:08.030 --> 20:09.180
I don't know how he is.

20:09.200 --> 20:10.620
You think I made no plans?

20:10.640 --> 20:11.660
Wanna copy scriptures again?

20:14.070 --> 20:15.090
All this noise.

20:15.960 --> 20:17.250
What's going on?

20:19.000 --> 20:20.620
Changshou, let me out.

20:23.960 --> 20:24.730
Grandlord.

20:25.960 --> 20:27.220
I failed you.

20:27.440 --> 20:29.380
If I had patrolled carefully

20:29.440 --> 20:30.980
and reported earlier,

20:32.000 --> 20:33.290
maybe this wouldn't have happened.

20:34.350 --> 20:34.940
Senior.

20:35.590 --> 20:36.660
Take good care of Grandlord.

20:36.680 --> 20:37.570
What are you doing?

20:38.550 --> 20:40.250
I'm going out to strike down all I can.

20:40.350 --> 20:41.530
I must avenge Grandlord.

20:41.550 --> 20:42.290
Have you lost your mind?

20:42.310 --> 20:43.180
I don't care.

20:44.680 --> 20:46.250
Ever since I joined this sect,

20:47.070 --> 20:48.420
I've done nothing but drink,

20:48.440 --> 20:49.700
mess up, and cause trouble.

20:50.880 --> 20:52.380
What else am I good for?

20:53.160 --> 20:54.010
Even if you die,

20:54.030 --> 20:55.460
would that make it right with Grandlord?

20:55.790 --> 20:57.290
Then let this be Grandlord's punishment.

20:58.160 --> 20:59.770
I'll pay with my life.

21:00.350 --> 21:01.490
Out of my way.

21:01.880 --> 21:04.140
Grandlord punished you, not for death.

21:04.160 --> 21:05.380
He wants you alive.

21:05.440 --> 21:06.980
So you can protect everyone.

21:17.240 --> 21:19.050
If you hadn't patrolled today,

21:20.880 --> 21:21.980
who would have saved us?

21:28.960 --> 21:30.250
Every time Grandlord punished you,

21:30.880 --> 21:32.900
others thought he was disappointed.

21:33.680 --> 21:36.250
But he always favored you the most.

21:42.440 --> 21:44.050
If Grandlord really hated you,

21:44.880 --> 21:47.050
he'd have struck you.

21:49.880 --> 21:51.050
But over all these years,

21:52.200 --> 21:53.570
did he ever hurt you?

21:56.680 --> 21:57.420
Jiu Jiu,

21:59.680 --> 22:01.330
in the name of Senior,

22:02.510 --> 22:03.980
I punish you on Grandlord's behalf.

22:06.440 --> 22:09.250
Jiu Jiu of Griefbane, hear my command.

22:12.680 --> 22:13.980
You must stay here

22:15.070 --> 22:16.490
and protect the Hall of Mortal Coils

22:17.830 --> 22:19.660
and all the disciples.

22:19.680 --> 22:21.090
Do not take a single step away.

22:22.070 --> 22:22.420
But I...

22:22.440 --> 22:23.180
Obey the command.

23:00.640 --> 23:01.620
I obey.

23:15.790 --> 23:16.380
Senior.

23:18.000 --> 23:18.900
Stop crying.

23:20.750 --> 23:22.700
Mentor wasn't like this before.

23:25.960 --> 23:26.860
Mentor

23:28.030 --> 23:29.290
can definitely be saved.

23:31.240 --> 23:32.010
Highly unlikely.

23:32.550 --> 23:33.140
He's under Curse Sorcery.

23:35.160 --> 23:36.140
Curse Sorcery?

23:38.790 --> 23:39.460
What did I say?

23:40.000 --> 23:40.660
Curse Sorcery.

23:42.960 --> 23:45.250
A thousand years ago,

23:45.270 --> 23:46.460
during the Deity-Demon War,

23:47.000 --> 23:48.460
there was a demon clan

23:48.590 --> 23:51.460
that could control minds with curses.

23:52.070 --> 23:52.940
Later, that clan

23:53.350 --> 23:55.660
was wiped out by the Grand Mage.

23:55.790 --> 23:57.140
I guess some survived.

23:57.750 --> 23:58.900
They're after the Seizing Sect.

23:59.680 --> 24:01.460
Can my Mentor still be saved?

24:01.480 --> 24:02.010
It's a long shot.

24:04.480 --> 24:05.530
But for unresolved matters,

24:05.550 --> 24:06.940
we must rely on our own efforts.

24:08.790 --> 24:09.940
Thanks, Stone Man.

24:10.920 --> 24:11.700
Senior.

24:12.720 --> 24:13.940
Mentor will surely be back.

24:16.830 --> 24:17.530
Ascendance Sect.

24:19.160 --> 24:19.940
Let me out.

24:19.960 --> 24:22.090
So noisy. Shut up.

24:22.550 --> 24:23.330
Who are there?

24:23.510 --> 24:25.140
You don't know who we are?

24:25.640 --> 24:27.810
We are the Xiongs.

24:28.000 --> 24:30.140
Born with divine strength and looks,

24:30.200 --> 24:31.860
unmatched by anyone in the world.

24:31.960 --> 24:32.860
In what way?

24:32.920 --> 24:34.050
In being shameless?

24:35.790 --> 24:36.660
Hey, Ascendance Sect.

24:37.240 --> 24:38.220
Can you keep me here?

24:38.790 --> 24:40.770
I come and go as I please.

24:41.400 --> 24:43.290
I'm staying because I want to.

24:49.640 --> 24:50.980
What took you so long?

24:51.000 --> 24:52.530
Your Highness, I'm here to save you.

24:52.920 --> 24:54.050
Your Highness?

24:57.110 --> 24:57.900
Well...

24:58.960 --> 24:59.700
It's just...

24:59.720 --> 25:01.660
My family is a bit special.

25:06.750 --> 25:07.770
You know each other?

25:07.790 --> 25:09.530
Why did you pick on him yesterday?

25:10.680 --> 25:12.530
Yesterday was a misunderstanding.

25:12.550 --> 25:14.530
I didn't see he was holding back.

25:15.400 --> 25:16.660
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

25:17.160 --> 25:17.900
Come here.

25:18.510 --> 25:19.990
- She looks super rich.
- This battle is a human affair.

25:19.990 --> 25:21.020
- It has nothing to do with us.
- We need a plan

25:21.020 --> 25:21.620
to scam her.

25:22.160 --> 25:24.330
Pearl Elites will protect you.

25:24.590 --> 25:26.530
Good, let's get out of here first.

25:26.550 --> 25:26.980
Come on.

25:27.110 --> 25:27.490
Let's go.

25:29.550 --> 25:30.250
What are we waiting for?

25:30.640 --> 25:31.180
Stone Man.

25:31.680 --> 25:32.140
Actually,

25:33.590 --> 25:33.860
I...

25:34.680 --> 25:36.090
I can't leave with you.

25:36.240 --> 25:36.730
Why?

25:37.310 --> 25:37.860
Think about it.

25:38.350 --> 25:39.620
My Mentor, Senior,

25:39.640 --> 25:40.530
and my Juniors

25:40.550 --> 25:41.050
are all here.

25:41.750 --> 25:42.770
How can I abandon them?

26:00.110 --> 26:00.900
An earthquake?

26:02.350 --> 26:02.940
Don't worry.

26:03.240 --> 26:04.980
Not a quake. The Defending Formation

26:05.590 --> 26:06.530
is about to break.

26:07.350 --> 26:07.770
We're doomed.

26:10.480 --> 26:11.050
Set up the formation.

26:19.440 --> 26:20.900
After today,

26:21.640 --> 26:24.140
Ascendance Sect will be devastated.

26:25.160 --> 26:28.290
Elder Kuai Si will save the day

26:28.310 --> 26:32.490
and rebuild with Westdawn's help.

26:33.550 --> 26:34.620
From then on,

26:35.110 --> 26:37.050
I'll shock the Primordial World

26:37.350 --> 26:39.980
and make history.

26:46.270 --> 26:47.460
The Ascendance Sect people

26:47.480 --> 26:51.090
did gather on one peak.

26:52.640 --> 26:55.380
Surround them and leave none alive.

26:55.750 --> 26:57.620
We will kill Changgeng

26:58.310 --> 26:59.860
and find the Pregenesis Sword.

27:16.750 --> 27:18.700
You dare block my way?

27:38.880 --> 27:39.860
A toad?

27:43.950 --> 27:45.960
♪I don't ask, too lazy to fight♪

27:46.110 --> 27:48.040
♪I dare to live my own way♪

27:48.040 --> 27:50.400
♪In the Primordial World♪

27:50.400 --> 27:52.380
♪Who sings and drinks free♪

27:52.540 --> 27:54.750
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

27:54.750 --> 27:56.790
♪Roaming the city with reckless courage♪

27:57.350 --> 27:58.940
Senior, what were you doing?

27:59.140 --> 28:00.480
♪And in dreams, I reign supreme♪

28:00.480 --> 28:01.700
Remember the Gnatsting Needle?

28:02.880 --> 28:04.620
I read many books

28:05.070 --> 28:06.490
until I found it

28:06.590 --> 28:08.330
in one that recorded

28:08.350 --> 28:09.490
about ancient demons.

28:09.790 --> 28:11.140
It's called Gnatsting Needle.

28:12.030 --> 28:14.700
A weapon of the Blood Gnat Clan.

28:15.590 --> 28:17.770
The weapon Yuan Qing used to strike.

28:17.790 --> 28:18.490
Right.

28:19.400 --> 28:20.250
Since then,

28:20.550 --> 28:22.330
I've been setting up defenses.

28:22.350 --> 28:23.290
Didn't you notice

28:23.640 --> 28:25.290
the local plants and animals

28:25.310 --> 28:27.010
have been growing so fast?

28:27.250 --> 28:29.580
♪Let the thoughts weigh♪

28:29.750 --> 28:31.050
Senior, you are amazing.

28:31.070 --> 28:32.250
You even kept a backup plan.

28:32.250 --> 28:33.050
♪Unruly♪

28:33.050 --> 28:35.880
♪A carefree smile♪

28:53.030 --> 28:54.180
My linked maze formation

28:54.480 --> 28:56.940
was upgraded and optimized

28:56.960 --> 28:58.940
step by step

28:58.960 --> 29:00.250
during their trials.

29:00.510 --> 29:04.460
Now, it's a giant formation.

29:04.480 --> 29:06.860
Even Zhao Gongming can't escape it,

29:06.880 --> 29:08.940
let alone those attackers.

29:08.960 --> 29:10.730
They don't stand a chance.

29:11.350 --> 29:12.860
So you had it planned all along.

29:17.900 --> 29:20.020
[Lost?]

29:50.790 --> 29:52.940
What's wrong with this sect?

30:01.720 --> 30:03.530
I have waited so long.

30:04.750 --> 30:06.220
Why aren't they here?

30:08.640 --> 30:09.530
Did they

30:10.550 --> 30:13.420
run into trouble on the way?

30:23.240 --> 30:24.330
Finally.

30:26.110 --> 30:26.900
What is going on?

30:28.160 --> 30:29.010
Elder Kuai Si,

30:29.070 --> 30:30.770
Changgeng blocked our army.

30:30.790 --> 30:31.570
Help us...

30:35.830 --> 30:36.620
Mentor.

30:36.960 --> 30:38.140
We waited for two hours,

30:38.160 --> 30:40.050
and only a mosquito showed up.

30:43.880 --> 30:44.530
Good.

30:45.480 --> 30:46.250
Well done.

30:47.440 --> 30:48.380
Keep patrolling.

30:49.070 --> 30:50.090
Yes, Mentor.

30:54.160 --> 30:55.940
If there is a flaw in your plan,

30:56.440 --> 30:58.180
it must be your Mentor.

30:59.750 --> 31:00.940
Relax, Yunxiao.

31:00.960 --> 31:02.250
I put Mentor

31:02.270 --> 31:04.570
in the absolute safest place

31:04.790 --> 31:06.730
in our entire sect,

31:07.400 --> 31:09.180
protected by a linked maze.

31:09.200 --> 31:12.380
Aren't you afraid
he'll break the art himself?

31:14.000 --> 31:16.730
His foundation was damaged early on.

31:16.790 --> 31:18.860
I treated him for thirty years.

31:19.160 --> 31:20.980
If he forces through it,

31:21.240 --> 31:24.180
it will ruin his foundation again.

31:24.200 --> 31:25.730
When the next tribulation comes,

31:25.920 --> 31:27.330
he will surely die.

31:28.790 --> 31:31.140
Though Mentor isn't very bright,

31:31.400 --> 31:32.700
he still values his life.

31:34.400 --> 31:35.730
The unexpected always happens.

31:36.750 --> 31:39.490
Aren't you worried you missed something?

31:40.200 --> 31:42.570
After all, Fate is unpredictable.

31:43.830 --> 31:44.620
Junior?

31:48.240 --> 31:48.940
Senior?

31:50.270 --> 31:51.290
Is that you, Senior?

31:52.920 --> 31:53.570
Junior?

31:54.790 --> 31:56.090
Senior, is that you?

31:57.240 --> 31:58.420
Junior, where are you?

31:58.550 --> 31:59.860
I'm here.

32:00.750 --> 32:02.570
I'm here.

32:03.830 --> 32:04.660
Are you not here?

32:04.750 --> 32:05.460
Senior.

32:05.480 --> 32:06.420
I'm here.

32:06.440 --> 32:07.700
Don't leave, Senior.

32:07.960 --> 32:09.940
I've been waiting here, Senior.

32:10.160 --> 32:12.620
I thought someone would wait here.

32:13.030 --> 32:13.810
Senior.

32:14.440 --> 32:15.770
Senior, don't leave.

32:16.350 --> 32:17.380
Don't leave.

32:18.510 --> 32:20.290
I've been waiting here for you.

32:20.550 --> 32:21.220
So...

32:21.880 --> 32:23.490
I was overthinking?

32:32.400 --> 32:34.380
I've been waiting here for you.

32:43.920 --> 32:44.380
Mentor.

32:45.070 --> 32:45.530
Mentor.

32:46.310 --> 32:47.770
Mentor is trying to break it.

32:50.110 --> 32:51.140
Junior, cover for me again.

32:51.830 --> 32:52.250
Okay.

33:09.590 --> 33:10.380
Something's wrong?

33:12.960 --> 33:14.140
That old man hid something from me.

33:15.830 --> 33:16.730
So you miscalculated.

33:17.510 --> 33:18.700
My calculations were flawless.

33:19.030 --> 33:20.010
He's just too foolish.

33:20.200 --> 33:21.980
He walked into such an obvious trap.

33:22.400 --> 33:23.420
Did you ever consider

33:23.750 --> 33:25.620
that not everyone in this world

33:25.790 --> 33:26.860
calculates everything like you?

33:43.160 --> 33:43.730
Senior.

33:44.790 --> 33:45.620
Senior, wait for me.

33:46.070 --> 33:47.220
I'm here, Senior.

34:05.480 --> 34:06.140
Senior.

34:07.160 --> 34:07.810
Senior.

34:09.840 --> 34:10.530
Senior.

34:10.920 --> 34:12.170
Senior, where are you?

34:12.550 --> 34:14.740
I've been waiting here, Senior.

34:15.230 --> 34:16.010
Junior.

34:17.360 --> 34:18.130
Junior.

34:18.920 --> 34:19.690
Senior.

34:20.000 --> 34:21.130
Junior, I'm here.

34:22.920 --> 34:23.570
Senior?

34:29.550 --> 34:30.050
Senior?

34:40.150 --> 34:41.780
Tomorrow, you'll leave for the assembly.

34:42.030 --> 34:43.210
I'm worried your power is too weak

34:43.230 --> 34:44.460
to defeat the demons.

34:44.550 --> 34:45.980
So I made an amulet for you.

34:46.960 --> 34:48.260
Junior, I'm right here.

34:58.320 --> 34:58.820
Junior.

35:03.960 --> 35:05.090
This jade talisman

35:05.760 --> 35:07.860
was left by Senior.

35:14.670 --> 35:15.740
Kuai Si.

35:18.590 --> 35:19.530
My Senior

35:22.150 --> 35:24.780
gave this jade talisman to me.

35:42.440 --> 35:44.940
It's a Voice-Transmitting Jade Talisman.

35:45.110 --> 35:47.740
Found where the Divine-Demon

35:47.760 --> 35:48.860
Tribulation occurred.

35:49.190 --> 35:50.380
Inside this talisman

35:50.480 --> 35:52.170
are the words Senior Wan Jiangyu

35:52.840 --> 35:53.980
left for you.

36:09.880 --> 36:11.130
Kuai Si.

36:12.360 --> 36:13.130
There is nothing.

36:13.630 --> 36:15.420
I cast a Silencing Spell.

36:15.880 --> 36:16.570
Kuai Si!

36:22.550 --> 36:23.340
Kuai Si.

36:27.400 --> 36:28.570
Kuai Si. Junior.

36:30.070 --> 36:32.050
Please, I beg you.

36:32.110 --> 36:33.530
I beg you.

36:33.550 --> 36:34.380
I'll do whatever you want.

36:34.400 --> 36:35.780
I'm even willing to die.

36:36.630 --> 36:38.570
Please undo the spell.

36:38.590 --> 36:40.260
I want to hear what Senior said.

36:40.280 --> 36:42.210
I want to hear her voice.

36:43.590 --> 36:44.820
Do you want to know

36:45.230 --> 36:47.260
what she actually said to you?

36:47.280 --> 36:47.940
Yes.

36:47.960 --> 36:49.900
Yes. Yes.

36:51.190 --> 36:53.490
Just let Li Changshou

36:53.880 --> 36:56.740
enter the Mini Realm Scroll,

36:58.670 --> 37:01.690
and I'll undo this Silencing Spell.

37:08.840 --> 37:09.300
Fine!

37:10.320 --> 37:10.940
Fine.

37:11.320 --> 37:12.610
Fine. Kuai Si.

37:12.880 --> 37:13.740
Hurry and undo it.

37:14.030 --> 37:14.940
Please undo it now.

37:14.960 --> 37:16.610
Please. I'm begging you.

37:16.920 --> 37:18.420
Please. I'm begging you.

37:18.440 --> 37:19.980
Kuai Si.

37:20.360 --> 37:20.980
Please undo it.

37:21.000 --> 37:22.530
Kuai Si, I beg you.

37:39.960 --> 37:40.740
Senior.

37:41.920 --> 37:45.380
Wanna know where she actually went?

37:45.510 --> 37:47.860
Let me tell you.

38:03.710 --> 38:04.780
Kuai Si.

38:07.030 --> 38:07.530
Senior.

38:12.510 --> 38:15.130
What did you do to this talisman?

38:18.280 --> 38:19.300
This talisman

38:19.880 --> 38:23.690
was indeed left by Wan Jiangyu.

38:29.710 --> 38:30.490
However,

38:31.510 --> 38:34.380
I didn't find it in the South Sea.

38:36.480 --> 38:38.530
It was in Kuru Land.

38:40.360 --> 38:42.210
When I killed her.

38:45.710 --> 38:46.690
Back then,

38:47.070 --> 38:48.740
you were a perfect couple.

38:49.110 --> 38:50.530
Envied by everyone.

38:51.400 --> 38:53.130
But she was so beautiful,

38:53.760 --> 38:55.170
you weren't the only one

38:55.550 --> 38:57.530
who fell for her.

38:59.230 --> 38:59.780
Junior.

39:02.960 --> 39:03.900
Why?

39:04.760 --> 39:07.490
Why did she love only you?

39:07.630 --> 39:09.690
Only you, Qi Yuan.

39:10.230 --> 39:12.690
Why wouldn't she even look at me?

39:19.840 --> 39:20.610
Senior.

39:24.920 --> 39:26.170
What makes you so special?

39:27.510 --> 39:29.740
Why you? Why?

39:31.760 --> 39:33.900
I thought if I ruined you,

39:34.320 --> 39:36.090
she'd finally look at me.

39:36.400 --> 39:37.740
But I never expected

39:38.590 --> 39:40.090
she would leave Ascendance Sect

39:40.590 --> 39:43.090
just to save you.

39:45.230 --> 39:47.420
For a useless waste like you.

39:48.960 --> 39:51.420
She went into danger in North Land.

39:53.480 --> 39:55.380
Just for a waste like you!

39:56.960 --> 39:57.980
I hated her for that.

39:59.070 --> 40:00.650
So I followed her

40:00.960 --> 40:02.860
all the way to North Land.

40:08.630 --> 40:10.650
I lured a fierce beast

40:13.440 --> 40:14.690
to attack her.

40:32.360 --> 40:33.900
Senior, are you okay?

40:33.920 --> 40:36.980
Kuai Si, why are you here?

40:37.480 --> 40:39.340
Don't try to talk. I'll get you out.

40:39.760 --> 40:40.210
Come on.

40:41.320 --> 40:42.420
I won't make it.

40:44.800 --> 40:46.050
There's something

40:46.760 --> 40:47.980
I'd like to ask you.

40:49.800 --> 40:51.300
Please take this Jade Talisman

40:52.360 --> 40:53.740
back to Ascendance Sect

40:54.360 --> 40:55.980
and give it to Qi Yuan.

40:57.230 --> 41:00.490
I have so much to tell him.

41:01.190 --> 41:04.530
It's all in the Jade Talisman.

41:11.960 --> 41:13.090
It's for Qi Yuan?

41:14.030 --> 41:15.050
Please.

41:15.880 --> 41:17.380
Give it to Qi Yuan.

41:32.110 --> 41:32.740
Okay.

41:34.190 --> 41:34.940
Senior.

41:36.550 --> 41:37.530
I promise.

41:39.190 --> 41:41.690
I'll surely give it to Qi Yuan.

41:43.480 --> 41:44.980
All these years,

41:46.000 --> 41:49.170
you've been waiting for her like a fool.

41:49.550 --> 41:50.530
Actually,

41:52.000 --> 41:54.980
she died at my hand long ago.

42:00.480 --> 42:01.940
Qi Yuan.

42:03.190 --> 42:07.650
Watching you suffer lovesickness daily,

42:08.150 --> 42:11.260
it just makes me happy.

42:23.000 --> 42:24.090
Resentment

42:24.630 --> 42:28.530
is the finest weapon in this world.

43:02.760 --> 43:08.540
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

43:09.210 --> 43:15.910
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

43:17.440 --> 43:23.490
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

43:24.120 --> 43:30.570
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

43:31.310 --> 43:38.430
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

43:38.810 --> 43:45.710
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:46.090 --> 43:53.440
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

43:53.440 --> 44:00.610
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

44:16.750 --> 44:21.920
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

44:23.010 --> 44:30.030
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

44:31.220 --> 44:37.160
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

44:37.860 --> 44:44.940
♪Alas, our story is short♪

44:45.280 --> 44:52.390
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

44:52.710 --> 44:59.190
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

44:59.970 --> 45:07.180
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

45:07.570 --> 45:15.390
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
